<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00515">
	<title>Basic function</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>The basic function for Forward Collision-Avoidance Assist is warned and controlled in the following way.</p>
		<ul id="e02056">
			<li>
				<p>Collision warning</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Emergency braking</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Stopping vehicle and ending brake control</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="note" id="e02057">
			<ul id="e02058">
				<li>
					<p>The following warning message will appear on the LCD display.</p>
					<p>For more details, refer to the warning and control section of the function.</p>
					<ul id="e02059">
						<li>
							<p importance="high">Collision warning</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p importance="high">Emergency braking</p>
						</li>
						<li>
							<p importance="high">Drive carefully</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>